  "summary": "把 1..k 各放入矩阵一次，行条件规定上下关系、列条件规定左右关系，构造任一合法 k×k 矩阵；任一条件有环返回空。",
  "insight": "行、列约束是两张独立有向图。分别拓扑排序得到每个数字的行位置和列位置，再把 value 放到两位置交点。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "行列条件需分别检测环",
    "未放数字的格子为零",
    "每个数字恰出现一次"
  ],
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "two-independent-topological-orders",
      "title": "两次独立拓扑排序",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "用两个 DAG 顺序决定二维坐标。",
      "steps": [
        "topology(k,conditions) 建图入度并 Kahn 排序，返回 value→position；不足 k 节点返回 null",
        "分别求 rowPosition、columnPosition",
        "任一为空返回空矩阵",
        "matrix[row[value]][column[value]]=value"
      ],
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(k+conditions)",
        "space": "O(k+conditions)"
      },
      "files": {
        "java": "solutions/two-independent-topological-orders/Solution.java",
        "kotlin": "solutions/two-independent-topological-orders/Solution.kt",
        "cpp": "solutions/two-independent-topological-orders/solution.cpp"
      }
    }
  ]
